3
00:00:04,233 --> 00:00:04,933
Myth one.

4
00:00:05,167 --> 00:00:07,100
Biomass is just waste.

5
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:07,833
Fact.

6
00:00:07,967 --> 00:00:09,300
Once it is collected,

7
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:10,667
dried and processed,

8
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:11,300
it is a fuel,

9
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,000
with a spec sheet,

10
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:13,833
a price,

11
00:00:13,967 --> 00:00:15,933
