20
00:00:29,033 --> 00:00:30,100
Myth three.

21
00:00:30,367 --> 00:00:32,067
All straw is the same.

22
00:00:33,167 --> 00:00:33,500
Fact.

23
00:00:33,967 --> 00:00:34,733
Moisture,

24
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,100
